    "id": "peter-pan-world",
    "name": "Peter and Wendy",
    "description": "J. M. Barrie’s fantasy follows Wendy, John, and Michael Darling through the nursery window to Neverland, where flight and make-believe exist beside jealousy, danger, memory, and loss. Their adventures with Peter Pan, Tinker Bell, the Lost Boys, Tiger Lily, and Captain Hook become a searching story about home, storytelling, and the uneven passage of time.",
